      "writtenOn": "2026-01-21T06:03:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit suggestion: simplify the logic by removing `reset_stats`: \n```\nstatic int cmd_watchdoginfo(...)\n{\n  if (argc \u003d\u003d 2) {\n    if (strcmp(argv[1], \"reset_stats\") \u003d\u003d 0) {\n      reset_watchdog_stats();\n      printk(\"Watchdog stats reset.\\n\");\n      return EC_RES_SUCCESS;\n    } else {\n      printk(\"Invalid argument: %s\\n\", argv[1]);\n      return EC_RES_INVALID_COMMAND;\n    }\n  }\n\n  print_watchdog_info();\n  return EC_RES_SUCCESS;\n}\n```",
      "revId": "3526d04d18036c1aef9f81347731eff7c823cded",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
