      "message": "The current implementation of `reset_stats` prints the stats and also resets the stats. I think your suggestion is to just reset the stats and not print. I guess it\u0027s a preference. I found I usually wanted both when I was testing. I\u0027ll switch it if you think the current pattern is confusing.",
